sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / SRE
    participant OC as oc CLI<br/>(workstation)
    participant MG as must-gather Pod<br/>(cluster)
    participant API as kube-apiserver<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant FS as Pod Filesystem<br/>/must-gather/

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over User,FS: Flow 1: OpenShift Must-Gather Collection
        User->>OC: oc adm must-gather --image=must-gather
        OC->>API: Create must-gather Pod<br/>Auth: kubeconfig
        API-->>MG: Pod scheduled & started

        Note over MG: gather.sh detects OpenShift distro<br/>Sets operator/application namespaces

        par Parallel Component Collection (15+ scripts)
            MG->>API: oc adm inspect ns/redhat-ods-operator<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
            API-->>MG: Pod YAML, logs, events
        and
            MG->>API: oc adm inspect ns/redhat-ods-applications<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
            API-->>MG: Component state
        and
            MG->>API: kubectl get DSCInitialization,DataScienceCluster<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
            API-->>MG: Platform CRs
        and
            MG->>API: helm get values rhoai -n rhai-gitops<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
            API-->>MG: Helm release values & manifests
        and
            MG->>API: oc adm inspect (KServe, DSP, Dashboard, ...)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
            API-->>MG: Per-component CRs & namespace resources
        end

        MG->>FS: Write collected data to /must-gather/
        MG-->>OC: Pod completes (exit 0)
        OC->>MG: oc rsync /must-gather/ → local tarball
        OC-->>User: must-gather.tar.gz
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
        Note over User,FS: Flow 2: xKS (Non-OpenShift) Must-Gather Collection
        User->>API: kubectl apply -f must-gather-job.yaml<br/>Auth: kubeconfig
        API-->>MG: Job Pod scheduled & started

        Note over MG: gather.sh detects xKS distro<br/>(AKS/EKS/CKS via detect_k8s_distro)

        par Parallel Collection (LLM-D scoped)
            MG->>API: kubectl get InferenceService,ServingRuntime<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
            API-->>MG: Inference resources
        and
            MG->>API: kubectl get Certificate,Issuer (cert-manager)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
            API-->>MG: TLS certificate state
        and
            MG->>API: kubectl get Istio,VirtualService (Sail)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
            API-->>MG: Service mesh state
        and
            MG->>API: kubectl get LeaderWorkerSet<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
            API-->>MG: LWS state
        and
            MG->>API: kubectl get Gateway,HTTPRoute (Gateway API)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
            API-->>MG: Ingress infrastructure
        end

        MG->>FS: Write to /tmp/must-gather/
        MG-->>API: Job completes
        User->>MG: kubectl cp must-gather-pod:/tmp/must-gather/ ./<br/>Auth: kubeconfig (exec channel, TLS 1.2+)
        MG-->>User: Diagnostic data
    end
